      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766781739266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 98260,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766781743599999
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. May I have your order number?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766781745599999
    },
    {
      "text": "It's VF-2025-11-07B. For the cycling shoes.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 98260,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766781750399999
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you. I have your order pulled up. Just to make sure I understand, what specifically is the issue with the shoes? Is it a technical fault or more of a preference issue?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
